<title>UK: British Steel year profits tumble.</title>
<headline>British Steel year profits tumble.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 29, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		15.22		  vs 38.28</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7			vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 10		     vs 10</p>
<p> Pretax		     451		    vs 1.10 bln</p>
<p> Turnover		   7.22 bln	     vs 7.05 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range</p>
<p>between 450 and 485 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - British Steel Plc.</p>
